# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [0.1.0] - 2023-03-05

### Added

- Add specific API peripheral
- Integrate with "FreeRTOS Kernel V11.1.0"
- Add loggong mechanism based on USART printf
- Add system health monitor based on internal temperature sensor
- Enable analog watch dog for adc (AWD)


[0.1.0]: https://github.com/olivierlacan/keep-a-changelog/releases/tag/v0.0.1